1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 { Remember? } 3... f5 4. exf5 e4 5. Nd4!! { DO NOT take the "free" knight. } { [%csl Gf6,Rd4,Rh5][%cal Gg8f6,Rc6d4,Rd1h5] } 5... Nf6 (5... Nxd4 { +2.2 because of Qh5+. 😒 }) 6. Nxc6 { Which pawn should we capture with? } 6... bxc6 { We keep the d-pawn. } { [%csl Rd5][%cal Rd7d5] } 7. O-O { [%csl Gd5][%cal Gd7d5] } 7... d5 8. Bb3 { [%csl Gf5][%cal Gc8f5] } 8... Bxf5 { And black has a great position. -0.2. Great job! 😁 } *


