{ Before we begin our Ruy Lopez section, please hit the like button down there ⬇. It really helps me to reach more awesome viewers like you. :) }
1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 { Ok we learned how to fight the Italian but what to do if your opponent plays... } 3. Bb5 { The Ruy Lopez? 🤔🧐🤨 Guess what! Same battle plan! } { [%csl Gf5][%cal Gf7f5] } 3... f5 { [%csl Re4][%cal Rf5e4] } 4. exf5 { A lot of people like eating free stuff you know? Punish them! } 4... e4 5. Bxc6 { White tries to make an in-between move. How should you recapture? } 5... bxc6 { 👍 } (5... dxc6 { Stockfish likes this move but it will take the queen's off early. }) 6. Nd4 { How can we attack the knight? } 6... Qf6 { [%csl Rd4][%cal Rf6d4] } 7. c3 { Defending the knight, but we have a killer blow. What is it? } 7... Ba6 { [%csl Gf1][%cal Ga6f1] } 8. Qg4 { The most played move. White wants to get rid of e4 so they can play d3. } { [%csl Gd3,Re4][%cal Ga6d3,Rg4e4] } 8... Bd3 { [%csl Re4][%cal Rd3e4] } 9. f3 { Most played. "I MUST GET RID OF THAT ANNOYING PAWN." We have many options here, but its -3.2 for us and were completely winning. 😉 } *


